{
	"metadata":{
		"version":"1.0-1.0",
		"frontmatter":{"id":"se.machine-systematic","kind":"machine","statement":"Full systematic rigor: onboarding then nine gated milestones from vision to ship - Onboard, Frame, Understand, Specify, Explore, Decide, Prove, Build, Validate, Ship.","entry":"onboard_retro","reentry":"restart"}
	},
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"c-head","type":"text","text":"# The systematic machine\nNine milestones, each ending in an owner-adjudicated gate. Edges are dependencies: all successors of a completed state may run in parallel; a state with several fired inputs waits for all of them. Gate reviews follow meth-gate-review; three states seed iteration-local sub-machines (candidates, spikes, build chunks). Runs on the parallel executor once it lands - drawn now as the binding spec.","x":-620,"y":-400,"width":1100,"height":260},
